<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">Dear<b> {!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c}</b>,</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">After careful review of the proposal and the presentation before the Selection Committee, we would like to inform you that the application titled "<b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b>" submitted by the <b>{!IndividualApplication.COE_Location__c}</b> WIN-COE has not been selected for funding support by the <b>{!IndividualApplication.Account}</b>.</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">The review panel’s comments and feedback:</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">.</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">You are encouraged to consider these recommendations should you wish to revise and resubmit the proposal in future rounds</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;of calls for applications</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">.</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">Please do</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">n’t </span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;hesitate to reach out to WIN team at win.support@wadhwanifoundation.org if you would like to discuss the feedback or next steps.</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;">Sincerely,</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:3.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.0000pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Arial;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>